[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13680.189, "timestamp": "03:48:00", "text": "秒だけど、12秒くらいある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13686.79, "timestamp": "03:48:06", "text": "ああ、また銃を手に入れたぞ。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13710.469, "timestamp": "03:48:30", "text": "できる。何てことだ。あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13713.189, "timestamp": "03:48:33", "text": "音速は別として。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13715.269, "timestamp": "03:48:35", "text": "ない。いや、そうでもないよ。実際、私は行く"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13730.229, "timestamp": "03:48:50", "text": "いや、君は中間層だよ。押すことはできません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13732.71, "timestamp": "03:48:52", "text": "上。"}]